+| R4 Effective request identity  | Duplicate equivalent calls and false reuse of different inputs                                            | Full model-visible context/settings and owner/policy scope           | F16 first; canonical request builder/version; after-900 change, exact hit, model/detail/schema/policy changes, revoked and cross-owner negatives | Accurate reusable results; more key/storage work, no global sharing shortcut          |
